          <div class="">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-[18px]">
              What types of educational institutions do you work with?
            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                We’ve worked with a wide variety of educational institutions, including colleges and universities, large state schools, education technology startups, education-focused software companies, educational apps, liberal arts institutions, training and tutorial programs, and small career programs.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-[18px]">
              What types of videos can you make?
            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                We’ve partnered with universities and colleges large and small to create videos for their internal and external campaigns, including but not limited to commercials, hype videos, fundraising videos, testimonial videos, new student orientation videos, celebratory videos, training videos, internal informational videos, and educational series.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-[18px]">
              How much do higher education videos cost?
            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                Cost depends heavily on your project and its needs. Our live-action and animated video projects start at $10,000 and go up from there. For an accurate project estimate, <a href="/contact-us/">get in touch.</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-[18px]">
              How long does it take to complete a video?
            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                A video takes 3 months to produce on average, but it can take more or less time depending on video length and complexity, feedback turnaround time, and the deadlines on your plate.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-[18px]">
              Can you make animated videos?
            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                Yes, we can create animated, live-action, or combination videos based on your needs and goals. Live action videos are better for connecting with prospective students and donors, while animations can be useful for explaining complex subjects.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
