            </h3>
            <div class="text-colorText-body">
              <p>
                We’ll help you figure it out. We’ve worked with enough higher education clients to look at the challenges you face, understand how video can help, and ultimately design a solution that connects with your target audience to achieve the goals you’ve set for your school.
              </p>
